      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GUS THE JET (2) will take beating coming off a sharp 26.03 victory at this track over 461m. Top win latest and looms as the one to beat again. GREEDY BUTCHER (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 26.35 beating Bonneville. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to his name from five starts. Can measure up again. SCARRED (5) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten third (26.19) in a Grade 5 at this track last time out. Key player on best and worth another try. LOCHINVAR HORNET (7) in the money here last time and looks a top-three prospect again.",
